        <mxCell id="oWYSpkivO3OfPZszFI1K-159" value="The deployed lambda naming convention is as follows ...&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;APP-SHORT-NAME-service-ENV-FUNCTION-NAME&lt;br&gt;ex. ltr-service-dev-fedProxyTokenRequest&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Function name can be found in the serverless.yml file and is whatever name was provided for the function" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1">
